 299:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                 parameters for RTC alarm configuration
 300:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                 members of the structure and the member values are shown as below:
 301:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_alarm_mask: RTC_ALARM_NONE_MASK, RTC_ALARM_DATE_MASK, RTC_ALARM_HOUR_MASK
