 303:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_weekday_or_date: RTC_ALARM_DATE_SELECTED, RTC_ALARM_WEEKDAY_SELECTED
 304:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_alarm_day: 1) 0x1 - 0x31(BCD format) if RTC_ALARM_DATE_SELECTED is set
 305:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                                  2) RTC_MONDAY, RTC_TUESDAY, RTC_WEDSDAY, RTC_THURSDAY, RTC_FRIDAY,
 306:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                                     RTC_SATURDAY, RTC_SUNDAY if RTC_ALARM_WEEKDAY_SELECTED is set
 307:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_alarm_hour: 0x0 - 0x12(BCD format) or 0x0 - 0x23(BCD format) depending on the
 308:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_alarm_minute: 0x0 - 0x59(BCD format)
 309:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_rtc.c ****                   rtc_alarm_second: 0x0 - 0x59(BCD format)
